                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Biden Admin just announced new cuts to Medicare Advantage. About 26 million seniors are enrolled in these plans and will now have to pay more for their health care as a result of the Biden Admin's cuts.\n\nWe must hold Biden accountable for failing our seniors.",
