                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I passed my first @HouseCommerce bill through markup--the TELEMH Act! And it was even more special to have my son, John John, with me during the markup!\n\nThis legislation would revolutionize access to mental health care via telehealth. A big win for access to health care! https://t.co/TNx6PsgKN1",
