                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week, @HouseCommerce passed my bill, the TELEMH Act, out of committee.\n\nThis bill will expand critical access to mental health services via telehealth & address the hopelessness crisis in America.\n\nA special s/o to @RepDavid and @RepDonDavis, who were original cosponsors.",
