                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Americans deserve affordable access to quality healthcare. This shouldn't be a partisan issue.\n\nI was proud to support the Lower Costs, More Transparency Act--which will help cut the cost of drug prices and medical fees, while providing much needed transparency for patients.",
