                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I was honored to bring home $1.5M to benefit our seniors at the Shelby Rec. Center!\n\nUpholding the health & wellness of our seniors is non-negotiable. It's why I introduced the Protecting Social Security & Medicare Act, & it's why I will never stop fighting for our seniors! https://t.co/omSXUs7sfb",
