                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As a vet who has been to war, I know the transition to civilian life shouldn't be the hardest battle we face.\n\nThat's why I introduced my Veterans' Entry to Apprenticeship Act, and cosponsored bills like the Vet CENTERS for Mental Health Act and the Veterans Patient Advocacy Act.",
