                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As a veteran of Operation Iraqi Freedom, I know there is so much more we can do to help out our heroes that served. \n\nThat's why I cosponsored the Vet CENTERS for Mental Health Act to ensure that there are an adequate number of Vet Centers in each state.",
