                "text": "Last night, the House voted UNANIMOUSLY in favor of my TELEMH Act--legislation to expand access to mental health services! Mental health needs in are soaring, and access is often a prohibiter for those wishing to get help. It's time to bring people hope!\nhttps://t.co/BxyIeJyWXD",
