                "text": "As families gather this Christmas, too many are quietly stressed about medical debt.\n\nOnly in healthcare are prices hidden until after the procedure. Then, you get a bill that can financially ruin you.\n\nMy Patients Deserve Price Tags Act puts patients back in control by requiring upfront cost transparency so families can shop, compare, and aren\u2019t blindsided by devastating medical bills.",
